oya</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.090" end="02:22.980"><span begin="02:21.090" end="02:21.870">Destroya </span><span begin="02:21.870" end="02:22.260">Destroya </span><span begin="02:22.260" end="02:22.980">Destroya</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.980" end="02:29.100"><span begin="02:22.980" end="02:24.510">I </span><span begin="02:24.510" end="02:26.040">guess </span><span begin="02:26.040" end="02:27.570">there </span><span begin="02:27.570" end="02:29.100">sunk</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.100" end="02:29.490"><span begin="02:29.100" end="02:29.230">we're </span><span begin="02:29.230" end="02:29.360">the </span><span begin="02:29.360" end="02:29.490">enemy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.490" end="02:30.510"><span begin="02:29.490" end="02:30.000">Destroya </span><span begin="02:30.000" end="02:30.510">Destroya</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.510" end="02:31.320"><span begin="02:30.510" end="02:30.915">Destroya </span><span begin="02:30.915" end="02:31.320">DESTROYER</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.140" end="02:44.340"><span begin="02:42.140" end="02:42.360">I </span><span begin="02:42.360" end="02:42.750">don't </span><span begin="02:42.750" end="02:43.440">believe </span><span begin="02:43.440" end="02:43.830">in </span><span begin="02:43.830" end="02:44.340">God</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.490" end="02:46.710"><span begin="02:44.490" end="02:44.760">I </span><span begin="02:44.760" end="02:45.120">don't </span><span begin="02:45.120" end="02:45.930">believe </span><span begin="02:45.930" end="02:46.230">in </span><span begin="02:46.230" end="02:46.710">luck</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.890" end="02:49.050"><span begin="02:46.890" end="02:47.130">I </span><span begin="02:47.130" end="02:47.520">don't </span><span begin="02:47.520" end="02:48.330">believe </span><span begin="02:48.330" end="02:48.690">in </span><span begin="02:48.690" end="02:49.050">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="